hough it will be a whole  new ensemble from the one nikolai new on  game of thrones he notes that the new  series has an incredible cast i hope  they'll have all the success  now about game of thrones he said i miss  my friends on the show we all became  friends after working together for  nearly a decade i really miss going to  work and seeing the gang and the crew  so as you can see he didn't say a whole  lot during the interview but like i said  earlier i still enjoy reading what they  have to say about working on game of  thrones and or what they think about the  new show house of the dragon i'm sure  once hbo starts releasing the new  episodes everyone from game of thrones  will have a whole lot more to say  and as always i will be here making  videos about everything every step of  the way i hope all of you subscribe and  join me for the ride i want to thank  everyone for watching the video i will  see you again soon  bye  [Music]  [Music]  you

